    <description>Visit Voice is the voice‑enabled, conversational form of the Visit Intelligence Assistant, designed to help field teams and planners interact with visit execution data hands‑free and in real time.
It allows users to start visits, retrieve visit details, log observations, update visit status, and close visits using natural voice commands, while ensuring all actions are accurately recorded in Consumer Goods Cloud Visit Execution.
Visit Voice transforms on‑ground execution into immediate, structured intelligence that feeds back into AI‑driven retail readiness, demand validation, and expansion decisions within the VyuhX platform.</description>
